    "product_details_qtAwpA": {
      "type": "product-details",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_tab_AeLFxf": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "file_text",
            "iwidth": "custom",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "heading": "About this item",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>10,000mAh All-Day Warmth: </strong>Our 2*5000mAh rechargeable hand warmers delivers 9~24H of continuous heat, perfect for those who need reliable warmth from morning commutes to evening adventures. No more worrying about frequent recharging, just consistent comfort that keeps up with your longest days and coldest nights.</li><li><strong>360° Instant Heat in 3s: </strong>Experience complete hand warmth with our cylindrical surround heating that activates in just 3 seconds. Unlike other flat designs that leave fingers cold, our electric hand warmers ensure uniform heat distribution across your entire hand, providing immediate relief from winter's chill.</li><li><strong>4-Temperature Precision Control: </strong>Choose from four precise heat settings up to 140°F, maintaining consistent warmth without fluctuations. Advanced smart chip technology prevents overheating while ensuring reliable performance whether you're braving snowstorms or enjoying gentle indoor warmth.</li><li><strong>Magnetic Versatility & Convenience: </strong>Strong magnetic suction allow seamless combination for shared warmth or separate use in these innovative magnetic hand warmers. The snap-together design ensures easy storage and prevents loss, making them perfect for couples, families, or individual users seeking flexible heating options.<br/>Ultra-Portable & Alloy Casing: Crafted from aircraft-grade aluminum, our hand warmers feature a premium shell that provides superior heat conduction and durability. Lipstick-sized & light design, this portable handwarmers can slides effortlessly into pockets or gloves, making them the perfect invisible companion for all your winter adventures.</li><li><strong>Certified Safe & Perfect Gift:</strong> UL-certified with advanced overheating protection and precision temperature control, these hand warmers deliver reliable performance for all winter activities such as camping,hunting, golfing, commuting, etc. The elegant packaging and exceptional warmth also make them the perfect gift for family and friends.</li></ul>",
            "metafields": "",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        },
